<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoNodeCopy</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Create a copy of a node</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Node.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">SilikoNode *SilikoNodeCopy(const SilikoNode *source);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoNodeCopy</function> function copies the value
of <varname>source</varname> into a new <type>SilikoNode</type>
object. If <varname>source</varname> is a branch, then a deep copy
is made.</para>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Return Values</title>
<para><function>SilikoNodeCopy</function> returns the copy created if
successful, or <literal>NULL</literal> if an error occured.</para>
</refsection>
